Black Friday shopping in France? 🛍️🇫🇷 Say THIS

• en promotion = on sale
• un cadeau = a gift
• une écharpe = a scarf
• je la prends = I'll take it
• c'est pour offrir ? = is it a gift?

🛍️ What would you buy? Comment "Je cherche ___" 👇
💌 Save this for your next shopping trip
👯 Send it to your shopping buddy

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

